/T (For the first time in decades, Norwegian football is dreaming big again. A nation once known for fearless Viking explorers is now preparing for a new journey on the world's biggest football stage. Just as the mighty Myklebust Viking Ship carried Norwegians across the seas more than 1,000 years ago, a new generation is ready to carry Norway onto the global stage. The Vikings are coming back. The question is: how far can they go?)
